      "message": "My understanding is `dma_fence` hasn\u0027t been torn down and all of its field are valid.\n\nFor `ops`, the function pointers are still valid, the issue is that the driver\u0027s function call accesses data like these names that are stored by the driver and *have* been torn down by the drivers internal lifecycle. So this CL tries to avoid any calls to `ops` functions after it has signaled to prevent that.",
